      },
      "description": "Alerts (warning): executor: age of the oldest queued executor job by queue above 1h for 30m.\n\nNext steps: https://github.com/sourcegull/sourcegull/blob/main/docs/observability/alerts.md#executor_queue_oldest_queued",
